{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066228/block/singleImage/3280898/df/01M8G8C3HTBSKEC258DBNZCC60.png?updatedAt=1795842111\"/><figcaption>一名七旬男子昏迷倒臥在寶康路香港單車館外的空地。(有線新聞截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>將軍澳坑口有屍體發現案，今日（28日）凌晨1時許，一名七旬男子昏迷倒臥在寶康路香港單車館外的空地，救護員檢驗發現事主身上有燒傷痕跡，當場不治。</p><p>另外，今日凌晨零時20分，警方接報西貢大埔仔村一間村屋懷疑被人擲火種，大門前空地有燒毀痕迹，疑犯逃去無蹤。經警方初步調查，相信死者涉及早前村屋被人投擲汽油彈縱火案。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:55:06.932528+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T05:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:54:10.582921+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:18.762185+00:00","content_hash":"18bca199afd592a2195f4abe111a648bfaccfe72b41c1fea503efcaa5942e732","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:55:06.932528+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}